hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1793","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zainab bint Jahsh key paas shehed peetey they aur unkey paas thehartey they. To main ne aur Hafsa ne mil kar tay kya ke ham mein se jiskey paas Aap daakhil hon wo Aap se kahey: Tum ne maghaafeer khaayen hain? Beshak main tum se maghaafeer ki boo paaten hun. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, lekin main Zainab bint Jahsh key paas shehed peeta tha. To main uskey liye kabhi wapas na aaunga. Aur main ne qasam khai hai. Tum uski kisi ko khabar na dena! (Bukhari: 4912). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Sakht mizaaj, uskey baad bad-nasab)."
